#: kcmkonsole.cpp:43
msgid ""
"<h1>Konsole</h1> With this module you can configure Konsole, the KDE terminal "
"application. You can configure the generic Konsole options (which can also be "
"configured using the RMB) and you can edit the schemas and sessions available "
"to Konsole."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Konsol</h1> KDE'neñ konsole atlı terminal yazılımın bu modul aşa köyläp "
"bula. Konsolnıñ töp köyläwlären dä üzgärtep bula (alar RMB aşa köylänä), tösläw "
"tözeleşen dä, sessilärne dä."

#: kcmkonsole.cpp:51
msgid ""
"_: normal line spacing\n"
"Normal"
msgstr "Ğädäti"

#: kcmkonsole.cpp:56
msgid "KCM Konsole"
msgstr "KCM Konsolı"

#: kcmkonsole.cpp:57
msgid "KControl module for Konsole configuration"
msgstr "Konsol caylawçı KControl modulı"

#: kcmkonsole.cpp:162
msgid ""
"The Ctrl+S/Ctrl+Q flow control setting will only affect newly started Konsole "
"sessions.\n"
"The 'stty' command can be used to change the flow control settings of existing "
"Konsole sessions."
msgstr ""
"Yaña cibärelgän konsol sessilärendä genä Ctrl+S/Ctrl+Q çaptırmaları eşli.\n"
"Barlıqta bulğan sessi üzençäleklären üzgärtü öçen 'stty' boyırığın qullanıp "
"bula."

#: kcmkonsole.cpp:170
msgid ""
"You have chosen to enable bidirectional text rendering by default.\n"
"Note that bidirectional text may not always be shown correctly, especially when "
"selecting parts of text written right-to-left. This is a known issue which "
"cannot be resolved at the moment due to the nature of text handling in "
"console-based applications."
msgstr ""
"İkeyünäleşle yazma çığaru töpcay itep sünderelgän buldı.\n"
"Belep torası, ikeyünäleşle yazma çığaru qayçaqta döres bulmawı da bar, "
"uñdan-sulğa barğan yazmalarnı saylağanda bigräk tä. Bu qíınlıq bilgele inde, "
"consollı yazılımnarda bu arada anı çişep bulmí äle."

